[{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10103002_00_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10103002_00_0010","text":"——制作人！生日快乐…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10103002_00_0020","text":"…………咦？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10103002_00_0030","text":"…………呼……呼…………\n————…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10103002_00_0040","text":"睡着了……\n制作人，累坏了呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10103002_00_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10103002_00_0050","text":"记得毛毯是在这里……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10103002_00_0060","text":"一直以来谢谢你……\n最喜欢你了"}]
